<h1 style="color:#fff !important;">DepEd's Project Bukas Feedback Form</h1>
</div>
<p></p>
<p>The Department of Education (DepEd) remains steadfast in promoting transparency, integrity, and accountability by making basic education data accessible to the public which empowers internal and external stakeholders' participation in improving learning outcomes.</p>
<p>Your feedback matters in improving our data and service.</p>
<p>By answering this feedback form, you hereby consent DepEd to collect your information solely to be used for the monitoring and evaluation of the "Project Bukas" adhering to Data Privacy Act of 2012. </p>
